    '<ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700"><li>Perdita del 10% &rarr; serve un guadagno dell''11,1% per recuperare</li><li>Perdita del 20% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 25%</li><li>Perdita del 33% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 50%</li><li>Perdita del 50% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 100%</li><li>Perdita del 75% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 300%</li></ul>',
    '<ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700"><li>Perdita del 10% &rarr; serve un guadagno dell''11,1% per recuperare</li><li>Perdita del 20% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 25%</li><li>Perdita del 33% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 50%</li><li>Perdita del 50% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 100%</li><li>Perdita del 75% &rarr; serve un guadagno del 300%</li></ul><figure class="my-6"><figcaption class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Quanto serve per tornare in pari</figcaption><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><table class="w-full text-left text-[13px] text-gray-700 sm:text-sm"><thead class="bg-gray-50 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted"><tr><th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">Perdita</th><th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 text-right">Guadagno necessario</th><th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 text-right">Anni al 7% annuo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">−10%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">+11,1%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">1,6</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">−20%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">+25%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">3,3</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">−33%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">+50%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">6,0</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">−50%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">+100%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">10,2</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">−75%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">+300%</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">20,5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted">Anni necessari per recuperare con un rendimento medio del 7% l''anno, senza nuovi versamenti. La riga del 33% indica un terzo del capitale.</p></figure>'),
